tate":"3","role":0,"stats":[34,25,81,78,70,63],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1015305","helmet":"WP1025605"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1012","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[34,25,81,78,70,63],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1015305","helmet":"WP1025605"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1026","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[34,25,81,78,70,63],"title":-1,"rank":"5","loyalty":"97","reputation":"16700","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1015305","helmet":"WP1025605"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10314","city":"CS1012","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[34,25,81,78,70,63],"title":-1,"rank":"5","loyalty":"97","reputation":"16700","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1015305","helmet":"WP1025605"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"袁绍谋主，荀彧之兄。出身颍川荀氏，起初为韩馥的谋士，韩馥在收到公孙瓒进攻冀州的消息时与辛评谋划请袁绍援助，以三寸不烂之舌说服韩馥让出冀州，让袁绍兵不血刃夺得天下重镇。官渡之战前夕持主战观点，使袁绍决定开战。其子荀闳在曹魏官至太子文学。","tc":"袁紹謀主，荀彧之兄。出身潁川荀氏，起初為韓馥的謀士，韓馥在收到公孫瓚進攻冀州的消息時與辛評謀劃請袁紹援助，以三寸不爛之舌說服韓馥讓出冀州，讓袁紹兵不血刃奪得天下重鎮。官渡之戰前夕持主戰觀點，使袁紹決定開戰。其子荀閎在曹魏官至太子文學。","en":"Chief strategist of Yuan Shao and elder brother of Xun Yu. From the Xun clan of Yingchuan, he initially served as an adviser to Han Fu. When Han Fu received news of Gongsun Zan's attack on Ji Province, Xun Chen and Xin Ping devised a plan to request Yuan Shao's aid. With his silver tongue, he persuaded Han Fu to hand over Ji Province, allowing Yuan Shao to seize this strategic heartland without bloodshed. On the eve of the Battle of Guandu, he advocated for war, tipping Yuan Shao's decision to attack. His son Xun Hong later rose to the position of Crown Prince's Literary Companion in Cao Wei.","jp":"袁紹の参謀であり、荀彧の兄。潁川荀氏の出身。当初は韓馥の謀臣を務めた。公孫瓚が冀州へ侵攻するとの報を受けた際、辛評とともに袁紹への救援要請を進言し、その巧みな弁舌で韓馥を説得して冀州を譲らせ、袁紹が血を流すことなく天下の要衝を手中に収める契機を作った。官渡の戦いの前夜には主戦論を唱え、袁紹に開戦を決断させた。子の荀閎は曹魏において太子文学にまで昇った。","kr":"원소의 모주(謀主)이자 순욱의 형이다. 영천 순씨 출신으로, 처음에는 한복의 모사였다. 한복이 공손찬의 기주 침공 소식을 들었을 때 신평과 함께 원소에게 원조를 청할 계책을 세웠으며, 세 치 혀로 한복을 설득하여 기주를 넘겨주게 함으로써 원소가 피 한 방울 흘리지 않고 천하의 요충지를 손에 넣게 만들었다. 관도대전 직전에는 주전론을 펼쳐 원소가 개전을 결심하도록 이끌었다. 아들 순굉은 조위에서 벼슬이 태자문학에 이르렀다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10316","remark":"","surname":"荀","surnameTc":"荀","surnameEn":"Xun","surnameJp":"荀","surnameKr":"순","surnameOther":"","name":"谌","nameTc":"諶","nameEn":"Chen","nameJp":"諶","nameKr":"심","nameOther":"","word":"友若","wordTc":"友若","wordEn":"Youruo","wordJp":"友若","wordKr":"유약","wordOther":"","icon":"荀谌","power":"WJ10314","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"184","city":"CS1026","gender":"0","rule":"34","force":"25","wise":"81","politics":"78","charm":"70","will":"63","ruleTalent":"2","forceTalent":"1","wiseTalent":"10","politicsTalent":"10","charmTalent":"6","willTalent":"6","weaponMaster":"8/8/8/8/8/78/33/8","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"1002705;1001905;1007401","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"1015205","debateSoul":"1000201","warSoulPoint":"1100","battleSoulPoint":"600","debateSoulPoint":"6000","strategy":"1004215","strategy2":"1001705;1001915","professions":"0/0/0/0/0/0/2/1/2/2/2/0/0/2/0/1/3/5/2/2/0/0/0/1","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"4","compatible":"56","loyalty":"97","reputation":"16700","evaluate":"0","title":"","rank":"5","birth":"164","show":"184","death":"208","age"